    "exact_scope": "Every normal good affine cone over an algebraically closed trivially valued characteristic-zero field; all nonproportional and irrational Reeb fields. Actual H/CPSH/PSH order transport and normalized onto E1 comparison with exp(plus/minus(2n+1)delta) energy bounds. On compact Reeb sets, the canonical outer extension agrees with every actual PSH energy and has a potential-independent quadratic remainder for the fixed dense direction lattice, and uniform derivative for each fixed continuous direction given by the genuine probability MA. No singular envelope premise, general unbounded moving-field measure limit, or P13.2 existence claim.",
